#: oowriterimport.cc:482
msgid ""
"This document was created with the OpenOffice.org version '%1'. This filter "
"was written for version for 1.0. Reading this file could cause strange "
"behavior, crashes or incorrect display of the data. Do you want to continue "
"converting the document?"
msgstr ""
"Ci documint chal a stî fwait avou OpenOffice modêye %1. Cisse passete chal "
"a stî scrîte pol modêye 1.0. Lére li fitchî pout n' nén aveur li "
"rzultat ki vos ratindoz, håyner di crombe manire les dnêyes, ou minme "
"crasher. Voloz continouwer a cvierser l' documint?"

#: oowriterimport.cc:484
msgid "Unsupported document version"
msgstr "Modêye do documint nén sopoirtêye"

